Unicode character-property data
===============================

src/localization/unicode_grapheme_data.inc is a compact, modified representation
of Unicode 17.0.0 properties generated using utf8proc 2.11.3. It contains
grapheme-break, Extended_Pictographic and Indic-conjunct-break properties, not
the utf8proc implementation. Its upstream notices are reproduced in the
adjacent utf8proc-LICENSE.md.
https://github.com/JuliaStrings/utf8proc/tree/v2.11.3

The Default_Ignorable_Code_Point ranges in src/localization/text_rasterizer.c
are a compact, modified representation of Unicode 17.0.0 DerivedCoreProperties:
https://www.unicode.org/Public/17.0.0/ucd/DerivedCoreProperties.txt

The kana_compositions table in
installer/internal/localization/data/decoder-profiles.json is a compact
representation of Unicode canonical composition data for U+3040..U+30FF plus
the combining dakuten/handakuten marks. It is generated through Python's
unicodedata NFC normalization, not copied from game ROMs. These normalization
pairs are stable under the Unicode normalization stability policy.

